   1:../Src/main.c **** /**
   2:../Src/main.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:../Src/main.c ****   * @file    main.c
   4:../Src/main.c ****   * @author  MCU Application Team
   5:../Src/main.c ****   * @brief   LAN8670 10BASE-T1S (RMII) bring-up demo.
   6:../Src/main.c ****   *
   7:../Src/main.c ****   *          Startup sequence:
   8:../Src/main.c ****   *            1. 80 MHz system clock, ETH clocked from HCLK
   9:../Src/main.c ****   *            2. GPIO for the LEDs and the console UART
  10:../Src/main.c ****   *            3. PHY identification over MDIO (vendor / model / revision)
  11:../Src/main.c ****   *            4. PHY soft reset and optional PLCA configuration
  12:../Src/main.c ****   *            5. MAC/DMA configuration and start, link poll
  13:../Src/main.c ****   *            6. Periodic demo frames, received frames echoed on the console
  14:../Src/main.c ****   *
  15:../Src/main.c ****   *          Console: USART1 (PY-LINK VCP) at 921600 8N1
  16:../Src/main.c ****   *            PA9  -> PC RXD
  17:../Src/main.c ****   *            PA10 <- PC TXD
  18:../Src/main.c ****   ******************************************************************************
  19:../Src/main.c ****   * @attention
  20:../Src/main.c ****   *
